{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1724.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"d84a6052044c7e3071f9697ac5e4c1cbf3f029ff1852742ac64d2cb59c603d23","ja":"亜利沙の様子","zh":"亚利沙的情况","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1724.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"33706c3a7e7a8c34f5099fe08fe1f8852f645f4712e1126d72cbf784230af8bb","ja":"ありりん、絶対疲れてたよね？\nどうしたんだろう？　大丈夫かな～？","zh":"亚利沙绝对很累了吧？\n是怎么了呢？没问题吧～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1724.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"05aeb64906b27914f1099cd5796b067ee8fa76a268db8c8c55fe18a35bad0a71","ja":"無理してないか心配だね……。\n亜利沙ちゃんのこと、私たちで気にかけておこう。","zh":"真担心她有没有在勉强自己……\n亜利沙的事情，就由我们多留心照顾吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1724.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"b9492b71103152a192667d0561ae684ee6b583466273c2a8bbef9f46ab9f4ac5","ja":"こうして海美と美奈子は、亜利沙の様子を\n気にするようにしていたのだけれど……","zh":"就这样，海美和美奈子开始留意起\n亚利沙的情况，然而……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1724.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"e3f978afcf6676b32a3156be34381057a691649a7736f3b2c36157a3d96be631","ja":"アイドルちゃんのライブが同じ日に～！？\nあ、ありさはどうしたら……！？","zh":"偶像们的演唱会撞在同一天了～！？\n亚、亚利沙该怎么办才好……！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1724.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"aac3e4c44e92ba16bcfe4e16b2f6a1ea6f78a3d53e3bebc3704020adaa2b4dbc","ja":"缶バッジ全24種ランダム、カートン買いするしか……\nでも、そうするとアイドルちゃんのチェキが……。","zh":"徽章全24种随机，只能按箱买了吗……\n可是，那样的话小偶像们的拍立得就……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1724.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"048557fc73d2b59665f41fa4f9e374ab0f11d3e4550bdf65340a568d03f9cd2a","ja":"一週間後……","zh":"一周后……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1724.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"9dbac7e1912cf167c06eb34a7293aa941b0969582c922852322047172813e3e3","ja":"う～ん……推し活で悩んではいたけど、\nそれって、いつもの亜利沙ちゃんだよね？","zh":"嗯～……虽然她是在为推活烦恼，\n但那不是亚利沙平时的样子吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1724.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"de2dfb6da8d784825678862de3b79394284fc3bcaff13cffa1ee921424538553","ja":"うん。なんだかんだ言ってて、楽しそうだったし……。\nじゃあなんで、あんなに疲れてたのかな？","zh":"嗯。虽然说了这样那样的话，但看起来挺开心的……\n那为什么，会累成那样呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1724.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"54e0b95b4d37ea565e9612bc231d01b3d6dee8242291c0f666e154a173403818","ja":"ふぅ～………………。","zh":"呼～………………。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1724.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"fe82bf79cc9ca4bcf0ff2b9c1de32f3443b13304c041a74f4f300ff2452475da","ja":"わぁ、ありりん！？\n大丈夫！？　顔が真っ青だよ！？","zh":"哇，亚利凛！？\n没事吧！？脸色惨白惨白的哦！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1724.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"756d793e5e04e82387823707e4f0cdaaa9cc0ed747c9f84c8e632ca889921e79","ja":"だ、大丈夫です。\nちょっと休んだら治りますから。それじゃあ……。","zh":"没、没事的。\n稍微休息一下就会好了。那么……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1724.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"81da29c62dc0ab07d471b12636845dfffc0d501cb62d639acb472b16344e673a","ja":"待って！　さすがにこれ以上は放っておけないよ。\nいったいどうしたの？　私たちじゃ力になれない？","zh":"等一下！事到如今可不能再放着不管了。\n到底怎么了？难道我们帮不上忙吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1724.unity3d","item_key":"commands[41].text","source_sha256":"38af021aea52d18f181319e11b5bd33a709e1b86bb78362be742f0b681ceafef","ja":"私たちのこと、もっと頼ってよ！\nありりんが倒れちゃったら悲しいから！","zh":"再多依靠一下我们嘛！\n要是亚莉酱累倒了，大家都会难过的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1724.unity3d","item_key":"commands[42].text","source_sha256":"bb48e4e09ca4bd1c6068db1ccf0fa1c01287e77c449e12f2425e445c88d3ccb6","ja":"美奈子ちゃん……海美ちゃん……。\nすみませんでした！　お話しします！","zh":"美奈子……海美……。\n对不起！我这就坦白！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
